@Haroenv Thanks for your response!  

At first, I wasn't sure what you meant by `facetOrdering`, so I searched for it but couldn’t find much information. Eventually, I stumbled upon the settings in the "back office" under **Configuration → Filtering and Faceting → Facet Display**.  

It wasn’t immediately clear to me that I needed to add facets there as well. Thanks for pointing me in the right direction!
